---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="location"><span class="status-dot"></span> San Francisco, by way of Lagos & Ottawa</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Hi, I’m<br /><span class="hero-name">Saheed<svg viewBox="0 0 400 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11C99 0 255 1 394 7M57 16c95-8 214-9 300-6" /></svg></span><span class="hello-dot">.</span><span class="sr-only"> Akinbile</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">A founder, engineer, and a curious person.<br class="desktop-break" /> Currently building <a href={profile.minicor} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Minicor</a> as co-founder & CTO.</p>
    <p class="hero-aside">I’m into ambitious ideas, good conversations, and helping people get started. Glad you’re here.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-blue" href="#work">What I’m building <Arrow /></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#about">A little about me <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <span class="photo-note">Better with good people around.</span>
    <svg class="photo-arrow" viewBox="0 0 64 67" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4C43 7 20 36 49 50m-18-2 19 5 3-20" /></svg>
    <figure class="founder-photo">
      <img src="/images/minicor-founders.jpg" width="800" height="597" alt="Saheed, standing on the left, smiling with his Minicor co-founder Faiz" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption><span>Me & Faiz, building Minicor.</span><span class="photo-smile" aria-hidden="true">:)</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <a class="hero-yc" href={profile.yc} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="yc-mark">Y</span><span>Part of Y Combinator <b>Spring ’26</b></span><Arrow diagonal /></a>
  </div>
</section>
